<title>CHINA: INTERFORM CERAMICS YEAR NET OFF 24.1 PCT.</title>
<headline>INTERFORM CERAMICS YEAR NET OFF 24.1 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   9.5    vs 15.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    1.0    vs 2.5</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    70.32  vs 92.65</p>
<p>    Turnover		     846.13 vs 797.09</p>
<p>    Company name		 Interform Ceramics Technologies Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  September 15-22</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   October 17</p>
<p>NOTE - Interform Ceramics Technologies is principally involved in the design, supply and installation of ceramics production lines in China.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is two H.K. cents (including interim dividend of one cent) vs 3.5 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6368</p>
